CVEHOT — a rework of AIHOT

This repository is an independent derivative work of AIHOT (https://github.com/KKKKhazix/AIHOT).
The engine, the site framework, the selection and clustering pipeline and the public interfaces are
upstream code, used under the MIT License with the original copyright notice retained
(LICENSE, Copyright (c) 2026 数字生命卡兹克).

What this repository changed: the industry pack only — sources, categories, topics, prompts, selection
thresholds, site copy, and the site's own brand assets (site/brand/), plus two modules under modules/.
See README.md for the list.

The AIHOT name and logo are not used here, as the upstream notice above requires. This site's name is
CVEHOT and its icons are its own.

The feeds configured in industry/sources.json (GitHub Security Advisories, cvelistV5, CISA KEV, the
OpenSSF malicious-packages dataset and others) are public feeds of their publishers. Their content
belongs to them; the site shows only a summary and a link to the original.
